 <div class="dmRespRow u_1851670793" style="text-align: center;" id="1851670793"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1061054216"> <div class="dmRespCol small-12 medium-12 large-12" id="1990583633"> <div class="dmRespRow" id="1103796952"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1480375508"> <div class="dmRespCol large-6 medium-6 small-12" id="1327704215"> <div data-inject="gallery-pageDescription" class="u_1692848273 dmNewParagraph" id="1692848273"><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;" class="lh-1 font-size-20"><b><font style="color: rgb(234, 175, 10);">Tuevent</font> 
es una empresa con una dilatada experiencia en el sector de los eventos.&nbsp;</b></span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="background-color: transparent;" class="lh-1 font-size-20">Somos un grupo de profesionales <b>cualificados y comprometidos</b> 
con nuestros clientes, dando respuesta en cada momento a sus necesidades.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="" class="lh-1 font-size-20"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Ofrecemos un servicio</span> 
 <font style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(234, 175, 10);">#LlaveEnMano</font> 
 <span style="background-color: transparent;">para cualquier evento pasando por todas las etapas de la producci&oacute;n integral, desde la creaci&oacute;n de la imagen del evento hasta el montaje de carpas y stands.</span></span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="" class="lh-1 font-size-20"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Con oficinas en <b>Madrid</b> 
y <b>Granada</b>, damos servicio a nivel local, nacional e internacional.</span></span></div></div></div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol large-6 medium-6 small-12" id="1539877609"> <div data-inject="gallery-pageDescription" class="u_1570435235 dmNewParagraph" id="1570435235"><div style="text-align: center;"><b style="text-align: left; background-color: transparent;"><span class="lh-1 font-size-35 m-specific m-font-size-25" style="font-weight: 300;">&quot;Hacemos de la <span style="font-weight: 300;">tecnolog&iacute;a&nbsp;</span></span></b></div><div style="text-align: center;"><b style="text-align: left; background-color: transparent;"><span class="lh-1 font-size-35 m-specific m-font-size-25" style="font-weight: 600;"><font style="color: rgb(234, 175, 10);">el ingrediente principal y diferenciador&nbsp;</font></span></b></div><div style="text-align: center;"><b style="text-align: left; background-color: transparent;"><span class="lh-1 font-size-36 m-specific m-font-size-25" style="font-weight: 600;"><font style="color: rgb(234, 175, 10);"><span style="font-weight: 700;">en cada uno de nuestros proyectos&quot;</span></font></span></b><br/></div></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespRow u_1355843462" style="text-align: center;" id="1355843462"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1804798847"> <div class="dmRespCol small-12 medium-12 large-12 u_1213515467" id="1213515467"> <div class="u_1947379867 dmNewParagraph" id="1947379867"><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="" class="m-font-size-36 lh-1 font-size-48"><font style=""><font style="font-weight: 900; color: rgb(238, 181, 0);">#ON</font> 
<font style=""><b><span style="font-weight: 400;">Hacemos</span> 
eventos 360&ordm;</b></font></font></span></div></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1394759399 dmRespRow fullBleedChanged fullBleedMode" id="1394759399"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1118694982"> <div class="dmRespCol small-12 u_1597015375 medium-6 large-6" id="1597015375"> <div class="u_1476962672 dmRespRow" id="1476962672"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1276637634"> <div class="u_1855707316 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1855707316"></div> 
 <div class="u_1088610368 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1088610368"> <h4 class="u_1416420008 dmNewParagraph" id="1416420008" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"> <b> <span class="font-size-20 lh-1">Producci&oacute;n Integral de Eventos</span></b></h4> <div class="u_1850010914 dmNewParagraph" id="1850010914" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"> <font style="color: rgb(115, 113, 113);"><b>Llevamos a cabo tu evento de manera integral, ocup&aacute;ndonos de todas las fases de producci&oacute;n y organizaci&oacute;n de tu evento.</b></font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol small-12 u_1495408401 medium-6 large-6" id="1495408401"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1477436188" id="1477436188"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1487289531"> <div class="u_1352989689 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1352989689"></div> 
 <div class="u_1702200964 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1702200964"> <h4 class="u_1297277764 dmNewParagraph" id="1297277764" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"> <b><span class="font-size-20 lh-1">Destination Management Company</span></b></h4> <div class="u_1505616776 dmNewParagraph" id="1505616776" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><font style="color: rgb(115, 113, 113);"><b>Empresa de servicios profesionales con conocimiento local, experiencia y recursos, que trabaja en el dise&ntilde;o e implementaci&oacute;n de eventos: incluyendo actividades, tours, transporte y log&iacute;stica integral.</b></font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespRow" id="1346786344"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1287606939"> <div class="dmRespCol large-12 medium-12 small-12" id="1513650127"> <h2 class="u_1657276698 dmNewParagraph" id="1657276698" data-element-type="paragraph" style="transition: none; display: block;"><span style="font-size: 38px;"><b><span style="font-weight: 600;">Servicios</span></b></span></h2></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1741883040 dmRespRow fullBleedChanged fullBleedMode" id="1741883040"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1544898249"> <div class="dmRespCol small-12 large-4 medium-4 u_1960807049" id="1960807049"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1519469093" id="1519469093"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1431648797"> <div class="u_1723357296 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1723357296"></div> 
 <div class="u_1465762547 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1465762547"> <h4 class="u_1035443500 dmNewParagraph" id="1035443500" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"> <b> <span class="font-size-20 lh-1">Proveedores</span></b></h4> <div class="u_1407041788 dmNewParagraph" id="1407041788" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"> <font style="color:rgb(169, 169, 169);">Elegimos los proveedores que m&aacute;s se adecuen a tu evento y trabajamos en constante coordinaci&oacute;n con ellos.</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol small-12 large-4 medium-4 u_1114865332" id="1114865332"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1123369792" id="1123369792"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1991766418"> <div class="u_1707104248 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1707104248"></div> 
 <div class="u_1473530954 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1473530954"> <h4 class="u_1327215844 dmNewParagraph" id="1327215844" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"> <b> <span class="font-size-20 lh-1">Marketing ferial</span></b></h4> <div class="u_1962249912 dmNewParagraph" id="1962249912" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><font color="#a9a9a9">Te asesoramos desde el primer momento para que la exposici&oacute;n comercial cumpla con tus objetivos.</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol large-4 medium-4 small-12 u_1047852965" id="1047852965"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1102085881" id="1102085881"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1559396699"> <div class="u_1734910583 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1734910583"></div> 
 <div class="u_1312630441 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1312630441"> <h4 class="u_1447681302 dmNewParagraph" id="1447681302" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"><span style="font-size: 20px;">&Aacute;rea cient&iacute;fica</span></h4> <div class="u_1074038055 dmNewParagraph" id="1074038055" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><font color="#a9a9a9">Desde el dise&ntilde;o del programa hasta la recepci&oacute;n y gesti&oacute;n de los trabajos cient&iacute;ficos de tu congreso o jornada.</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1770154239 dmRespRow fullBleedChanged fullBleedMode" id="1770154239"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1121696812"> <div class="dmRespCol small-12 large-4 medium-4 u_1780186147" id="1780186147"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1301821965" id="1301821965"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1225008070"> <div class="u_1805224259 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1805224259"></div> 
 <div class="u_1375998464 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1375998464"> <h4 class="u_1898858016 dmNewParagraph" id="1898858016" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Gesti&oacute;n de asistentes</span></h4> <div class="u_1457024178 dmNewParagraph" id="1457024178" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"> <font style="color:rgb(169, 169, 169);">Nos encargamos de la plataforma de inscripci&oacute;n, control de base de datos, contacto con los asistentes y gesti&oacute;n de las necesidades de ponentes, invitados y organizaci&oacute;n.</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol small-12 large-4 medium-4 u_1590125720" id="1590125720"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1816526386" id="1816526386"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1715848827"> <div class="u_1014838458 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1014838458"></div> 
 <div class="u_1394684296 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1394684296"> <h4 class="u_1902868338 dmNewParagraph" id="1902868338" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Exposici&oacute;n comercial</span></h4> <div class="u_1493985178 dmNewParagraph" id="1493985178" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><font color="#a9a9a9">Dise&ntilde;amos y montamos tu stand en cualquier formato y evento. Nos ocupamos del dise&ntilde;o e impresi&oacute;n digital a todo color de todos los elementos de comunicaci&oacute;n de tu marca.</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol large-4 medium-4 small-12 u_1018219583" id="1018219583"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1364581086" id="1364581086"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1260288518"> <div class="u_1134692397 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1134692397"></div> 
 <div class="u_1883657284 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1883657284"> <h4 class="u_1725013894 dmNewParagraph" id="1725013894" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Dise&ntilde;o y desarrollo web</span></h4> <div class="u_1480317550 dmNewParagraph" id="1480317550" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><font color="#a9a9a9">Dise&ntilde;amos y desarrollamos la web adaptada a tu evento.&nbsp;</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespRow u_1925854249 fullBleedChanged fullBleedMode" id="1925854249"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1821169432"> <div class="dmRespCol small-12 large-4 medium-4 u_1816338893" id="1816338893"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1565179427" id="1565179427"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1668626595"> <div class="u_1437699619 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1437699619"></div> 
 <div class="u_1939709416 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1939709416"> <h4 class="u_1446055300 dmNewParagraph" id="1446055300" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Protocolo y relaciones institucionales</span></h4> <div class="u_1399561411 dmNewParagraph" id="1399561411" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><font color="#a9a9a9">Cartas de invitaci&oacute;n, confirmaci&oacute;n de asistencia de autoridades, ordenaci&oacute;n protocolaria de los actos con presencia institucional...</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol small-12 large-4 medium-4 u_1809048026" id="1809048026"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1511826080" id="1511826080"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1086702389"> <div class="u_1503014884 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1503014884"></div> 
 <div class="u_1891714202 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1891714202"> <h4 class="u_1828872682 dmNewParagraph" id="1828872682" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"> <b> <span class="font-size-20 lh-1">Eventos de incentivos</span></b></h4> <div class="u_1112847598 dmNewParagraph" id="1112847598" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><font style="color: rgb(169, 169, 169);">Organizamos experiencias motivadoras y &uacute;nicas para cargar de energ&iacute;a a tu equipo.</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol large-4 medium-4 small-12 u_1384437332" id="1384437332"> <div class="dmRespRow u_1287117637" id="1287117637"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1267758021"> <div class="u_1449241300 dmRespCol small-12 large-3 medium-3 empty-column" id="1449241300"></div> 
 <div class="u_1375702081 dmRespCol small-12 large-9 medium-9" id="1375702081"> <h4 class="u_1207757466 dmNewParagraph" id="1207757466" style="display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Tecnolog&iacute;a aplicada</span></h4> <div class="u_1778636336 dmNewParagraph" id="1778636336" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><font color="#a9a9a9">Usamos tecnolog&iacute;a aplicada para hacer eventos &uacute;nicos, experienciales y memorables para todos los asistentes.</font></div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
